  "text": "(3)$\\left[{\\frac{\\pi}{6}},^{+\\infty}\\right).$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L023",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "【分析】"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L024",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "（1）利用三角恒等变形，结合辅助角公式，化为正弦型函数，问题即可求解；"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L025",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "（2）利用正弦函数的单调性来求解即可；"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L026",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "（3）利用正弦函数的性质来判断即可."
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L027",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "【小问1详解】"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L028",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "f(x)=4\\cos x\\sin\\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)-\\sqrt{3}=4\\cos x\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos x\\right)-\\sqrt{3}=2\\cos x\\sin x+2\\sqrt{3}\\cos^{2}x-\\sqrt{3}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P9L029",
  "page": 9,
  "text": "第9页/共13页"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L001",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "\\sin2x+2\\sqrt{3}\\frac{1+\\cos2x}{2}-\\sqrt{3}=\\sin2x+\\sqrt{3}\\cos2x=2\\sin\\left(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L002",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "可得：当$2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi,k\\in Z$ 时，函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 取到最大值2，此时：$x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}+k\\pi,k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$ ；"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L003",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "【小问2详解】"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L004",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "因为正弦函数的单调递减区间是$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi,\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi\\right],k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L005",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "所以由$\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi\\leq2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\leq\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi,k\\in Z.$ ，解得$\\frac{\\pi}{12}+k\\pi\\leq x\\leq\\frac{7\\pi}{12}+k\\pi,k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L006",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "即函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的单调递减区间是$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{12}+k\\pi,\\frac{7\\pi}{12}+k\\pi\\right],k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$ ;"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L007",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "【小问3详解】"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L008",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "因为函数$f(x)=2\\sin\\left(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L009",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "当$x\\in\\left(0,t\\right]$ 时，$2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\in\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3},2t+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right]$ ,"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L010",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "而正弦函数在$\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$ 上是单调递增，$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right]$ 上是单调递减，"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L011",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "由于si $\\ln\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L012",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "所以要使得函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 在区间$\\left(0,t\\right]$ 上取到最小值，则$2t+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\geq\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\Rightarrow t\\geq\\frac{\\pi}{6}$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L013",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "即实数t的取值范围是$t\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{6},+\\infty\\right)$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L014",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "22.【答案】$(1)-1$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L015",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "(2)$m\\in[-1,0)$ :"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P10L016",
  "page": 10,
  "text": "(3)$k<0$ 或$k=\\frac{4}{17} 或 k>\\frac{1}{2}$"
 },
