  "line_id": "P13L005",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "即数表$A_{k}$ 满足：$a_{11}=a_{22}=\\ldots=a_{kk}=-1\\left(1\\leq k\\leq n\\right)$ ，其余$a_{_{i j}}{=}1$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L006",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "所以$r_{1}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L007",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=r_{2}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L008",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=\\ldots=r_{k}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L009",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=-1$ $c_{1}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L010",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=c_{2}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L011",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=\\ldots=c_{k}"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L012",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "(A)=-1$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L013",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "所以$l\\left(A_{k}\\right)=2\\left[(-1)\\times k+(n-k)\\right]=2n-4k$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L014",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "由k的任意性知，$l(A)$ 的取值集合为、$\\left\\{2(n-2k)\\mid k=0,1,2,\\ldots,n\\right\\}$"
 },
 {
  "line_id": "P13L015",
  "page": 13,
  "text": "第13页/共13页"
 }
